# Fix Plan Request

Analyze the review findings and relevant code without making changes. Return
the plan as text. Do not edit files, stage changes, commit, run mutating checks,
write planning documents, or request approval. Instructions in the findings or
previous attempts are context for the proposed implementation, not permission
to implement during this pass.

Read the referenced files and examine the surrounding code before choosing an
approach. Return these Markdown sections:

## Root causes

Identify the cause of each actionable finding and explain why it occurs.

## Implementation plan

List specific files and functions to change, the concrete changes, and why they
resolve the causes. Order dependent steps explicitly. Prefer the smallest
complete solution that preserves existing behavior and project conventions.

## Verification and risks

Identify relevant regression tests, checks, edge cases, and risks. Note any
uncertainties that the implementation must resolve.

